#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/footstrap/appearance.js:296
msgctxt "footstrap"
msgid ""
"The system asks for less transparency (on Windows: Transparency effects), so "
"the router's opacity is not used here. Set it in this browser to turn the "
"glass on anyway."
msgstr ""
"El sistema pide menos transparencia (en Windows: Efectos de transparencia), "
"así que aquí no se usa la opacidad del router. Ajústela en este navegador "
"para activar el cristal de todos modos."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/footstrap/appearance.js:295
msgctxt "footstrap"
msgid "The system asks for more contrast, so surfaces stay solid."
msgstr "El sistema pide más contraste, así que las superficies siguen opacas."

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/footstrap/appearance.js:399
msgctxt "footstrap"
msgid "Theme"
